# Convex auto-generated client.
# These files used to be gitignored, but Vercel builds need them and can't
# run `convex codegen` without CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY in CI. Committing the
# generated client is a common pattern to keep CI builds simple — just
# remember to commit the new client whenever convex/schema.ts or function
# signatures change (running `npx convex dev` regenerates them).

